00:09:33.230 --> 00:09:34.863
it smells real nice.

00:09:36.310 --> 00:09:37.143
Yes, I love it.

00:09:37.143 --> 00:09:39.725
Oh my God, that smells
like peace, I love it.

00:09:39.725 --> 00:09:43.010
Alicia's new album is called "Alicia."

00:09:43.010 --> 00:09:44.640
Be sure to check it out.

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:46.710
Also check out her line
of personal care products,

00:09:46.710 --> 00:09:48.160
Keys Soulcare, this December.

00:09:48.160 --> 00:09:51.110
Don't forget, y'all
watch both of us tonight

